@* What a reference sheet says where the record would go and there is none — the board's and the
   island layout's, the two subjects that carry no reference text of their own and so would
   otherwise end in an empty body.

   Only ever rendered where a record was actually looked for: on the public routes nothing was
   fetched, so saying "no history" would be a claim about a reader the page knows nothing about.
   The sheets gate that themselves (ReferenceOnly); this is only the sentence. *@

<p class="no-value text-sm">No game history to show for this @Subject yet.</p>

@code {
    /// <summary>What the sheet is of, as a bare noun — "board", "layout".</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Subject { get; set; } = "";
}
